              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu Musa ka Aaron ka ekodet kere loka idwe luka Isirael kiswamakis Ilebin kwaŋin: kwape ajaatar kere nueeorakinit EJAKAIT Musa kanuka Ilebin, apotu idwe luka Isirael kiswamakis kes kwaŋin, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.15.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 15:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kitesegaros Ilebin karonisikee, kilota da ikeeenapen; koinak Aaron kes araut ainakinet naijaŋio kakonyen nuka EJAKAIT: ido kolue Aaron kes aitalaun kes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
