              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Nu kes akiro nuka Ilebin: ageun kaluka ikar akaisaarei ka lukany ka luedeparito, kes elomarete akapakin aijaanakin kaswam naka ewema loka airiamunun: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
