        {
          "text": " Konye inarakinetc iinaeanakee kotoma owema loka airiamunun, aidar nuititinitai, konye mam ijaanakinete. Iswamakini ijo Ilebin kwaŋin kanuka nuititinitai.”",
          "type": "text",
